      "finalEditorText": "",
      "transition": null,
      "trace": [],
      "chat": {
        "lineCount": 9579,
        "sha256": "b8ceb1b68c2271d12f4f5a51737c0f07d2c34ff00412eeb4b55ad3908487f85a",
        "raw": {
          "lineCount": 9579,
          "sha256": "89cda64b1ee192702499387326044682edee2fd05ab2777826d280a2055ec7ab",
          "head": [
            "",
            "\u001b[38;5;69m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m",
            " \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;109mWhat's New\u001b[39m\u001b[22m                                                                                         ",
            "",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;111m\u001b[1m[0.10.0] - 2025-11-25\u001b[22m\u001b[39m                                                                              ",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            " Initial public release.                                                                            ",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;111m\u001b[1m### \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;111m\u001b[1mAdded\u001b[22m\u001b[39m                                                                                          ",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mInteractive TUI with streaming responses                                                         ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mConversation session management with \u001b[38;5;109m--continue\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109m--resume\u001b[39m, and \u001b[38;5;109m--session\u001b[39m flags                   ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mMulti-line input support (Shift+Enter or Option+Enter for new lines)                             ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mTool execution: \u001b[38;5;109mread\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109mwrite\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109medit\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109mbash\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109mglob\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109mgrep\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109mthink\u001b[39m                                       ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mThinking mode support for Claude with visual indicator and \u001b[38;5;109m/thinking\u001b[39m selector                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mFile path autocompletion with \u001b[38;5;109m@\u001b[39m prefix                                                           ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mSlash command autocompletion                                                                     ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;109m/export\u001b[39m command for HTML session export                                                          ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;109m/model\u001b[39m command for runtime model switching                                                       "
          ],
          "tail": [
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mReduced worst-case automatic terminal theme detection delay from 200 ms to 100 ms by probing     ",
            "   color-scheme and background support concurrently.                                                ",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;111m\u001b[1m### \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;111m\u001b[1mFixed\u001b[22m\u001b[39m                                                                                          ",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mFixed Bun standalone binaries crashing on startup when the cwd contains a \u001b[38;5;109mbunfig.toml\u001b[39m with       ",
            "   \u001b[38;5;109mpreload\u001b[39m by compiling with \u001b[38;5;109m--no-compile-autoload-bunfig\u001b[39m (\u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m#7685\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m                                    ",
            "   \u001b[38;5;241m(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/pull/7685)\u001b[39m by \u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m@geril07\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m (https://github.com/geril07)\u001b[39m).      ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mFixed extension TUI method wrappers recursing indefinitely when delegating to the original       ",
            "   method (\u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m#7731\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/7731)\u001b[39m).                               ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mFixed right-click not pasting clipboard text in fullscreen mode on Windows.                      ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mFixed inherited \u001b[38;5;109mAgent.reset()\u001b[39m clearing transcript and runtime state during active runs; it now   ",
            "   rejects until the agent is idle (\u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m#7717\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/pull/7717)\u001b[39m by       ",
            "   \u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m@wesleyzhangwq\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m (https://github.com/wesleyzhangwq)\u001b[39m).                                              ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mFixed inherited LaTeX relation, multiplication, and named-operator spacing, and matrix           ",
            "   composition with stacked fractions, operator limits, and adjacent matrices.                      ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mReduced inherited fullscreen mouse event volume under tmux, Zellij, and GNU Screen by using      ",
            "   button-motion tracking instead of all-motion tracking.                                           ",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            "\u001b[38;5;69m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m"
          ]
        },
        "head": [
          "",
          "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────",
          " What's New",
          "",
          "",
          " [0.10.0] - 2025-11-25",
          "",
          " Initial public release.",
          "",
          " ### Added",
          "",
          " - Interactive TUI with streaming responses",
          " - Conversation session management with --continue, --resume, and --session flags",
          " - Multi-line input support (Shift+Enter or Option+Enter for new lines)",
          " - Tool execution: read, write, edit, bash, glob, grep, think",
          " - Thinking mode support for Claude with visual indicator and /thinking selector",
          " - File path autocompletion with @ prefix",
          " - Slash command autocompletion",
          " - /export command for HTML session export",
          " - /model command for runtime model switching"
        ],
        "tail": [
          " - Reduced worst-case automatic terminal theme detection delay from 200 ms to 100 ms by probing",
          "   color-scheme and background support concurrently.",
          "",
          " ### Fixed",
          "",
          " - Fixed Bun standalone binaries crashing on startup when the cwd contains a bunfig.toml with",
          "   preload by compiling with --no-compile-autoload-bunfig (#7685",
          "   (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/pull/7685) by @geril07 (https://github.com/geril07)).",
          " - Fixed extension TUI method wrappers recursing indefinitely when delegating to the original",
          "   method (#7731 (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/7731)).",
          " - Fixed right-click not pasting clipboard text in fullscreen mode on Windows.",
          " - Fixed inherited Agent.reset() clearing transcript and runtime state during active runs; it now",
          "   rejects until the agent is idle (#7717 (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/pull/7717) by",
          "   @wesleyzhangwq (https://github.com/wesleyzhangwq)).",
          " - Fixed inherited LaTeX relation, multiplication, and named-operator spacing, and matrix",
          "   composition with stacked fractions, operator limits, and adjacent matrices.",
          " - Reduced inherited fullscreen mouse event volume under tmux, Zellij, and GNU Screen by using",
          "   button-motion tracking instead of all-motion tracking.",
          "",
          "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
        ]
      }
    },
